      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process, immediately before that process starts**. \n\nThe key points are:\n\n1. The Hub process never holds the Anthropic API key in its own environment\n2. A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n3. The key is injected directly into the spawned child process\u0027s environment (not inherited from the Hub)\n4. The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated\n\nThe same pattern applies to the Query agent process as well \u2014 it also receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn time, never from the Hub\u0027s environment.",
